universal-java-installer (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of the fork of pardus-java-installer.
  * Ported UI to GTK4 + libadwaita.
  * Added apt, dnf and pacman backends with runtime detection.
  * Oracle JDK is downloaded from Oracle with explicit licence acceptance and
    SHA-256 verification instead of being installed from a repackaged archive.
  * Default JVM handling via update-alternatives or archlinux-java.

 -- Ruy Sabino Pereira <ruysabino@users.noreply.github.com>  Tue, 18 Aug 2026 18:00:00 +0000
